Magic=
Brutus has a 25% [[elemental weakness]] to [[earth spells]], which means that they have 25% increased accuracy and damage than normal, making them the best option at low levels. Magic can also use temporary safespots like ranged can. However, the rune cost for higher level spells like [[Earth Blast]] won't be covered by Brutus' drops.

